Armani Ferrante, CEO of Backpack, on what comes next for tokenized stocks.

"Not 10 stocks, not 100 stocks. We want to bring the entire stock market to Solana. One API where a real share, by any definition of the term, moves back and forth between your brokerage account and DeFi. Going from 200 symbols to 10,000 is the next leap."

@armaniferrante @Backpack
